@startuml adcDriverStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Initialized
state Running

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Initialized : Init(config)\n[pConfig != NULL]
Initialized --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

Initialized --> Initialized : ConfigureChannel()\nSetResolution()\nSetVoltageReference()\nSetSamplingFrequency()

Initialized --> Running : StartConversion()\n[channel enabled && !busy]

Running --> Running : Register callback during\nconversion execution

Running --> Initialized : StopConversion()\n[clears busy flag]

Initialized --> Initialized : ReadValue()\nIsConversionComplete()\nGetStatus()\nRegisterCallback()\n[no state change]

note right of Running
  busy flag = true
  LastValue[channel] updated
  Callback invoked if registered
  Returns to Initialized after
end note
@enduml
